kubeos-storage (1.0.0-9) trixie; urgency=medium

  * postinst: brace ${MOUNT} inside the grep patterns. shellcheck reads `$MOUNT[[:space:]]`
    as an array subscript (SC1087) and fails, and the braces state the intent either way;
    behaviour is unchanged. Found by running the new CI check over every repository before
    switching it on.

